# Rewritten as UTF-8. This file had UTF-16 appended to it, and git reads
# .gitignore as bytes, so every rule after the first two lines was unreadable
# and never took effect. That is why `dist/` is committed despite being listed
# here. Keep this file UTF-8.
#
# `dist/` is kept below because it was the evident intent, but note the built
# output is currently TRACKED: an ignore rule does not untrack anything, so it
# stays in the repo until it is removed from the index explicitly.
.vercel
.env*
node_modules/
dist/

# Impeccable session artifacts: decision-page payloads and answer logs.
.impeccable/questions/
.impeccable/direction-payload*.json
